# The context is CA1/part2, but the image needs only the executable JAR built
# on the host. Everything is excluded and that JAR is re-included. The plain
# JAR of the jar task (classes only, not runnable) is excluded explicitly: it
# also matches bookstore-*.jar and would make the COPY ambiguous.
*
!build/libs/bookstore-*.jar
build/libs/*-plain.jar
